#
# `draw-demo`: the functions of the compositor the shell's `draw` calls. The
# lava lamp follows the window's focus on the interface's io-channel, and asks
# `snapshot` for it when it starts and after records were dropped. An Alt-drag
# moves the window: `position` says where it starts, `move_window` moves it.
uses compositor_v1 via component compositor { pixel_order, create_window, commit, move_window, position, raise, destroy, snapshot }
